e email verification to prevent abuse.\",\n      \"actionItems\": [\n        \"Add email verification token to user model\",\n        \"Send verification email on registration\",\n        \"Create email verification endpoint\",\n        \"Prevent login until email is verified\",\n        \"Add resend verification email functionality\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"category\": \"PERFORMANCE\",\n      \"priority\": \"LOW\",\n      \"title\": \"Optimize Database Queries\",\n      \"description\": \"Add database optimizations for authentication queries.\",\n      \"actionItems\": [\n        \"Add index on users.email column\",\n        \"Use select to exclude password from default queries\",\n        \"Consider caching user lookups for active sessions\",\n        \"Implement connection pooling for database\",\n        \"Monitor query performance in production\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"reviewedAt\": \"2024-12-19T10:30:00Z\",\n    \"reviewerId\": \"claude-orchestrator-v1\",\n    \"toolsUsed\": [\n      \"mcp-github\",\n      \"code-quality-analyzer\",\n      \"test-coverage-analyzer\",\n      \"refactoring-suggester\"\n    ],\n    \"analysisDepth\": \"COMPREHENSIVE\",\n    \"estimatedFixTime\": \"16-24 hours\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Summary\n\nThis Pull Request implements basic user authentication for the todo app, but it has **critical security vulnerabilities** that must be addressed before merging:\n\n**🔴 CRITICAL ISSUES:**\n1. JWT secrets are hardcoded and exposed\n2. Passwords are not hashed before storage\n3. No rate limiting allows brute force attacks\n\n**🟡 HIGH PRIORITY ISSUES:**\n4. Missing refresh token mechanism\n5. Insufficient input validation\n6. Zero test coverage for authentication\n\n**Verdict: NEEDS_CHANGES** - The PR introduces important functionality but requires significant security improvements before it can be safely merged. I recommend addressing all critical and high-priority issues, adding comprehensive tests, and followin